\[
\langle\hat H\rangle
=\frac{(\Delta p)^2+\langle p\rangle^2}{2m}
+\frac{m\omega^2}{2}
\left[(\Delta x)^2+\langle x\rangle^2\right].
\tag*{[2]}
\]

Part (b): Reconstruct the complete mathematical chain for Zero-Point Energy, from the starting relation to the final result. Include every required substitution, derivative, integral, or limiting step.
